-- ============================================================================
-- 099_live_chat_support_and_message_flexibility.sql
-- Landing-page Live Chat Support + flexible short messages.
--
-- LIVE-DATABASE SAFETY
--   * Additive / forward-only. Safe after 098.
--   * Does NOT UPDATE, DELETE, TRUNCATE, rename, or rewrite any existing user,
--     financial, subscription, receipt, message, inquiry, wallet, inventory,
--     session, credential, or business row when this migration is installed.
--   * Creates two isolated support tables and replaces RPC definitions only.
--   * New rows are created later only when a visitor starts a live chat.
